message: "If you use Pidgeon in a report or publication, please cite it as below."
title: "Pidgeon: process diagram editor for pharma (PFD, P&ID and single-use assembly drawings)"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Minhazuddin
    family-names: Mohammed
    alias: MinaryBytes
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-12"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MinaryBytes/Pidgeon"
url: "https://minarybytes.github.io/Pidgeon/"
abstract: >-
  Free, open-source, browser-based editor for pharmaceutical process flow
  diagrams, piping and instrumentation diagrams and single-use assembly
  drawings, with ISA-5.1 instrumentation, line and equipment lists, a
  bill of materials, and PDF and DXF export.
keywords:
  - process flow diagram
  - P&ID
  - single-use
  - biopharmaceutical manufacturing
  - process engineering
